#  * g_resources.apkUpdateStatus() -> "state<TAB>done<TAB>total<TAB>message" ("" off Android); cancelApkUpdate().
#  The JNI call is androidApkUpdate in androidwindow.cpp (one Java method, op = start | status | cancel).
